    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "passage": "Pulitzer Prize – winning writer H éctor Tobar has built a multifaceted career as both a journalist and an author of short stories and novels. In an essay about Tobar’s work, a student claims that Tobar blends his areas of expertise by applying journalism techniques to his creation of works of fiction.",
